---
import Jobs from '../Jobs/index.astro';
import Updates from '../Updates/index.astro';
---
<section id="about" class="section about-section">
  <h2>I love a<br />good interface.</h2>
  <div class="about-copy"><p>I love UI design: the typography, the interactions, and the small decisions that make a product feel right. I like being involved from the first idea through implementation, shaping the experience through both design and code.</p><p>My own apps give me room to explore ideas and experiment. I set the product direction, work with AI coding agents on design and implementation, and keep reviewing and refining the result until it feels worth using.</p><a class="button" href="/cv/">See my CV</a></div>
  <details class="section-disclosure about-disclosure">
    <summary><span class="disclosure-closed">More about me</span><span class="disclosure-open">Less about me</span></summary>
    <div class="about-expanded">
      <Jobs compact />
      <Updates compact />
    </div>
  </details>
</section>
